---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LookbookGallery from '../components/LookbookGallery.astro';
import MannequinCatalog from '../components/MannequinCatalog.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Lookbook & Moodboard Display Toko Baju — Link Manekin"
  description="Koleksi foto lookbook dan moodboard display toko fashion: manekin display butik, distro streetwear, activewear sports, warm atelier couture, dan gawangan baju."
  image="/images/lookbook/premium-mannequin-showroom-moodboard.png"
  imageAlt="Koleksi retail lookbook dan moodboard display toko baju"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Beranda', href: '/' },
    { name: 'Lookbook', href: '/lookbook/' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="section-shell page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">VISUAL MERCHANDISING PORTFOLIO</p>
    <h1>
      Inspirasi display retail
      <br />
      <em>dari konsep hingga toko nyata.</em>
    </h1>
    <div class="intro-bottom">
      <p>
        Jelajahi studi bentuk, penerapan pencahayaan toko, dan keselarasan antara manekin dengan interior retail.
        Setiap foto lookboard dirancang untuk membantu Anda menemukan karakter display terbaik untuk brand Anda.
      </p>
      <a class="button button-dark" href="#lookbook-gallery">Jelajahi 8 konsep display ↘</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <LookbookGallery />

  <section class="section-shell studio-section" aria-labelledby="custom-lookbook-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">CUSTOM INTERIOR & DISPLAY</p>
      <h2 id="custom-lookbook-title">
        Ingin menerapkan konsep
        <br />
        <em>serupa di toko Anda?</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="studio-text">
      <p>
        Diskusikan langsung kebutuhan display Anda bersama tim studio kami. Kami melayani pengadaan manekin custom finishing warna/tekstur, gawangan industrial knock-down, hingga hanger kayu butik berlogo.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="button button-dark" href="https://wa.me/6281389896052?text=Halo%20Link%20Manekin%2C%20saya%20mau%20konsultasi%20paket%20display%20seperti%20di%20lookbook." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Konsultasi Project via WhatsApp ↗
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <MannequinCatalog limit={4} heading={true} />
</Layout>
